# Boggart Prankster, "Whenever you attack, target attacking Goblin you control gets +1/+0 until end of turn" (CR 508.1, 603.2,
# 115.1). Bot1 attacks with the Prankster (a 1/3 Goblin), Bile-Vial Boggart (a 1/1 Goblin) and an Ornithopter (0/2, no Goblin):
# the Ornithopter is refused as a target and the Boggart chosen, so it is 2/1 with its toughness unchanged, the Prankster still
